                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Resolved</hi>, That this company desires to express its
                    deep sorrow and indignation at the assassination of Mr. Lincoln, President of
                    the United States, and to record, in common with the whole British nation, its
                    profound sympathy with the government and people of America at the very serious
                    loss they have sustained by the atrocious crime which has just been
                    perpetrated.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
